6. Role Responsibilities 

Role 

What They Actually Do 

System Admin 

Users, roles, permissions, company setup, services, regions, rate cards, integrations, email and system configuration 

Management 

View overall business performance, leads, opportunities, proposals, sales pipeline and reports 

Lead Actioner 

Receive new leads, review AI analysis, contact prospect, enrich information, qualify/disqualify, follow up and assign to Sales 

Sales Manager 

Manage sales team, distribute deals, monitor pipeline, approve/oversee opportunities and manage sales performance 

Sales Executive 

Work assigned accounts/deals, communicate with client, arrange site visit, collect requirements and manage opportunity 

Survey Manager 

Create/manage survey assignments, select surveyor, schedule surveys and monitor survey completion 

Surveyor 

Visit site and capture building/floor/space information, measurements, conditions, photos, services required, frequency and manpower requirements 

Estimator / Commercial 

Use survey information + rate card to calculate manpower, pricing, cost and proposal 

Operations Manager 

Review won contract and prepare operational handover 

